  "notes": [
    "Original generated pixel artwork, informed by ZERO Sievert screenshots; no extracted game art.",
    "Ground anchors are shared within state pairs. Generator smoke and worklamp activation use actual distinct frame shapes.",
    "Vehicles are east-facing static intact/wreck states, not driving animations.",
    "Worklamp activation is a one-shot animation that holds its final frame.",
    "Spikes and barricades have static intact/broken state art, not destruction animation.",
    "Sprites preserve source RGBA, including a few partly transparent edge pixels."
